WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:02.340
- So you're also in the hit
show, "Ghosts," obviously.

00:00:02.340 --> 00:00:04.859
So your character is
a closeted gay soldier

00:00:04.859 --> 00:00:07.140
from the American Revolution.
- Yeah. Yeah.

00:00:07.140 --> 00:00:08.287
- Were you just like,

00:00:08.287 --> 00:00:10.980
"This is so funny and
awesome, I wanna do this"?

00:00:10.980 --> 00:00:11.813
- Yes, exactly.

00:00:11.813 --> 00:00:13.110
- [Kelly] It just seems like a fun role.

00:00:13.110 --> 00:00:14.730
- Yeah, it is. It's so fun.

00:00:14.730 --> 00:00:16.740
It was, you know, it's like
when you kind of get that

00:00:16.740 --> 00:00:18.210
as like your character breakdown

00:00:18.210 --> 00:00:19.509
when you're gonna go to audition,

00:00:19.509 --> 00:00:23.940
like the connection bells
don't immediately go right off,

00:00:23.940 --> 00:00:25.117
but then you see this and you're like,

00:00:25.117 --> 00:00:27.749
"Oh, this is so funny. I have to do this."

00:00:27.749 --> 00:00:30.690
And it's been this like really fun journey

00:00:30.690 --> 00:00:33.750
of playing this like
pompous, ridiculous man who,

00:00:33.750 --> 00:00:36.990
I was in the closet for 21 years,

00:00:36.990 --> 00:00:38.979
and he was in the closet for 250 years.

00:00:38.979 --> 00:00:42.390
(all laughing)

00:00:42.390 --> 00:00:43.223
You know what I mean?

00:00:43.223 --> 00:00:45.908
Like some stuff was ready to come out.

00:00:45.908 --> 00:00:48.060
- It took a minute.

00:00:48.060 --> 00:00:50.220
I know, he's this dead
guy and he still hasn't

00:00:50.220 --> 00:00:51.053
come out.
- Figuring it out.

00:00:51.053 --> 00:00:52.229
- Yeah, exactly.

00:00:52.229 --> 00:00:53.317
(all laughing)

00:00:53.317 --> 00:00:54.360
- Oh, my god, that's awesome.

00:00:54.360 --> 00:00:56.419
I love you. I love all
the projects you're doing.

00:00:56.419 --> 00:00:57.283
- Thank you so much.
- Congratulations.

00:00:57.283 --> 00:00:58.477
- Thank you.

